## 7. Modules

### 1. Home / Dashboard Module

* Displays the main hotel search section.
* Shows recommended and popular hotels.
* Provides navigation to different sections of the website.

### 2. Hotel Search Module

* Allows users to search hotels by location.
* Displays relevant hotel results.
* Provides a simple and user-friendly search interface.

### 3. Hotel Recommendation Module

* Displays recommended hotels.
* Shows hotel name, image, location, price, and rating.
* Helps users identify suitable accommodation options.

### 4. Filter Module

* Filter hotels according to price range.
* Filter hotels based on ratings.
* Filter hotels according to available amenities.

### 5. Hotel Details Module

* Displays detailed information about selected hotels.
* Shows facilities and amenities.
* Displays pricing, location, ratings, and other relevant information.

