* Mobile application development.

---

## 11. Conclusion

The **Hotel Recommendation System** provides a simple and effective solution for helping users discover hotels according to their requirements. The project demonstrates the practical implementation of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to create an interactive and responsive web application.

It helps strengthen fundamental front-end development concepts while solving a real-world problem related to hotel selection. The project can further be developed into a complete full-stack hotel booking and AI-powered recommendation platform.

